    "extraction_notes": [
      "PDF SHA-256 verified as 9a9126e58d24004d0174fbf6f3937491847b02076133bb079cf987a694df5658.",
      "The datasheet identifies the device as an N-channel enhancement-mode MOSFET and shows the AO3400-ED ordering identity on every electrical page.",
      "Curve points are direct readings from the labelled or grid-aligned plotted traces in Figures 5, 6, 7, 10, and 12. No points were extrapolated beyond a plotted trace or interpolated between unlabelled source data.",
      "The table lists VSD typical = 0.75 V and maximum = 1.2 V at VGS = 0 V and IS = 3.3 A; the schema has one body_diode slot, so the typical value is represented and the maximum is retained here.",
      "The table also publishes IDSS max = 1 uA at VDS = 20 V, VGS = 0 V; IGSS max = +/-100 nA at VGS = +/-12 V, VDS = 0 V; gFS typ = 8 S at VDS = 5 V, ID = 3 A; Qg typ/max = 2.9/5 nC, Qgs typ = 0.4 nC, and Qgd typ = 0.6 nC at VDS = 10 V, ID = 3 A, VGS = 4.5 V. These have no corresponding fields in the strict schema.",
      "Thermal table data includes RthetaJA max = 139 degC/W for the stated surface-mounted FR4 condition; the strict schema has no thermal field."
